{"unit_id":"xinyang920__dsh-caps-beacon#card-zh","repo":"xinyang920/dsh-caps-beacon","commit":"9c7738f7b9873e3954a3284863be4fda58b2ec58","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-caps-beacon（DSH 插件，适用于加载该插件的 DSH 客户端）：把 MacBook 内置键盘的 Caps Lock 指示灯用作 DSH 状态提示。它监听 agent 状态、审批请求、工具执行和会话事件，并通过原生 beacon-led 助手控制指示灯。根 agent 工作时常亮，审批、等待回答或任务报错时闪烁，空闲时熄灭；助手异常退出后会自动重启并恢复当前状态。适合在后台运行 DSH 时通过键盘查看任务是否需要关注。需要 macOS、带内置 Apple 键盘的 MacBook，以及 Xcode Command Line Tools 编译助手。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:216-259","native/led.c:32-109","Makefile:1-14"]}
{"unit_id":"xinyang920__dsh-caps-beacon#card-en","repo":"xinyang920/dsh-caps-beacon","commit":"9c7738f7b9873e3954a3284863be4fda58b2ec58","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-caps-beacon uses a MacBook Caps Lock LED as a DSH task light. It stays on while root agents work, blinks for approvals, questions, or failed turns, and turns off when idle. It restarts its helper after unexpected exits. Requires macOS, a built-in Apple keyboard, and Xcode Command Line Tools.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:216-259","native/led.c:32-109","Makefile:1-14"]}
