{"unit_id":"xinyang920__dsh-caps-beacon#feature-1","repo":"xinyang920/dsh-caps-beacon","commit":"9c7738f7b9873e3954a3284863be4fda58b2ec58","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-caps-beacon 的功能「运行状态灯」：根 agent 开始运行时点亮 Caps Lock LED，所有根 agent 停止后熄灭；子 agent 默认不参与状态判断。插件通过 agent/status 事件更新运行集合。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:175-221"]}
{"unit_id":"xinyang920__dsh-caps-beacon#feature-2","repo":"xinyang920/dsh-caps-beacon","commit":"9c7738f7b9873e3954a3284863be4fda58b2ec58","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-caps-beacon 的功能「待处理提醒」：有审批请求、ask_user_question 或 exit_plan_mode 等待时让指示灯闪烁，等待结束后重新显示运行状态。可分别通过 triggers 配置相关触发条件。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:31","index.mjs:223-239","index.mjs:188-205"]}
{"unit_id":"xinyang920__dsh-caps-beacon#feature-3","repo":"xinyang920/dsh-caps-beacon","commit":"9c7738f7b9873e3954a3284863be4fda58b2ec58","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-caps-beacon 的功能「错误状态提示」：根会话以 error 或 blocked 结束时锁存闪烁状态，直到下一个根 turn 开始；可用 triggers.error 关闭这类提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:241-249"]}
{"unit_id":"xinyang920__dsh-caps-beacon#feature-4","repo":"xinyang920/dsh-caps-beacon","commit":"9c7738f7b9873e3954a3284863be4fda58b2ec58","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-caps-beacon 的功能「助手故障恢复」：LED 助手意外退出或启动失败后按递增间隔重试；助手重新就绪时重新应用当前灯态，避免状态提示一直中断。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:75-137","index.mjs:208-214"]}
